00:13:52.496 --> 00:14:00.143
Suddenly, his mouth opened, and his face went white.

00:14:00.203 --> 00:14:10.354
Slowly, he began to fall, and his big body hit the road.

00:14:10.414 --> 00:14:13.840
The dog came up to him.

00:14:13.901 --> 00:14:18.384
But the peddler did not move.

00:14:18.444 --> 00:14:23.478
Allison watched John Law for a minute.

00:14:23.538 --> 00:14:28.972
