00:14:29.032 --> 00:14:34.918
I felt afraid, but I ran along the road very quickly.

00:14:34.978 --> 00:14:36.158
Help!

00:14:36.219 --> 00:14:37.239
Help!

00:14:37.299 --> 00:14:39.070
I called to the villages.

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:42.185
The peddler is ill!

00:14:42.245 --> 00:14:49.270
The villagers came out of their houses and followed me down the hill.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:54.044
A young man looked at John Law carefully.

00:14:54.103 --> 00:14:59.666
He's not dead, he said, but he's very ill.

00:14:59.726 --> 00:15:03.268
Let's move him to the nearest house.

00:15:03.329 --> 00:15:07.751
Someone must go and call his son.

00:15:07.811 --> 00:15:10.463
Just then.

00:15:10.523 --> 00:15:15.366
John Law began to talk very slowly.

00:15:15.426 --> 00:15:19.168
I can't move.

00:15:19.228 --> 00:15:28.432
He said, I'm alive, but I can't move.

00:15:28.492 --> 00:15:33.484
I went back to stand near Allison.

00:15:33.544 --> 00:15:37.276
The dog sat at her feet.

00:15:37.336 --> 00:15:46.256
That device Girl, John Law said slowly.

00:15:46.316 --> 00:15:50.288
She, she cursed me.

00:15:50.348 --> 00:15:58.794
She wanted me to die, and her dog came to get me.

00:15:58.854 --> 00:16:03.326
All the villagers looked at Alizon.

