00:16:16.684 --> 00:16:21.435
You're a witch, and we don't want you in our village.

00:16:21.495 --> 00:16:27.907
Allison began to run away down the hill, and her dog followed.

00:16:27.967 --> 00:16:31.138
I watched the villagers.

00:16:31.198 --> 00:16:37.733
